@startuml Load Change and Re-declare Process

title Process: the load changes after its declarations were filed
caption Target design. Decisions D13, D27, X3, D24, D31, D32, O21. Plans 09 and 15.

|Dispatcher|
start
:Change a load\n(move, replace, refuse or remove a box);

|Freedom|
:Return affected approved manifests to Proposed;
:Compare each declaration's snapshot with the current load;
if (Declaration still open and load differs?) then (yes)
  :Show the declaration as Stale;
  :Raise a re-declare task on screen;
  :Block departure until resolved;
else (no, or already closed at its crossing)
  stop
endif

|Administrator|
:Re-approve the changed loads;

|Dispatcher|
repeat
  :Withdraw the stale declaration\n(record and old reference kept);
  switch (Which instrument?)
  case (GMR)
    :Update or recreate it, record the reference;
  case (ENS)
    :Invalidate and refile, record the new MRN;
  case (ELO)
    :Request a new envelope against the new MRN;
  case (Goods list)
    :Prepare a new goods list;
    :Send it to the Receiver to re-file;
    if (Goods already near the border?) then (yes)
      |Loader|
      :Hold the goods at a registered hub near the border;
      |Dispatcher|
    else (no)
    endif
    :Record the new reference;
  endswitch
repeat while (More stale declarations?) is (yes)
->no;

|Freedom|
:Clear the tasks;
stop

@enduml
